%% title: My class: one section, one page
%% desc: When a teacher is made class teacher or assistant class teacher of a section, that section appears on the My class page. At the top is a button to take today's attendance; below are six cards: Absent today, Attendance flags, Dues, Homework, Results, Students.
flowchart LR
  A["Admin<br/>gives the duty"]:::admin --> M["My class"]:::teacher
  M --> H["Take today's attendance"]:::teacher
  M --> C1["Absent today<br/>Attendance flags"]:::note
  M --> C2["Dues<br/>Homework"]:::note
  M --> C3["Results<br/>Students"]:::note
  classDef teacher fill:#e7f5ff,stroke:#1c7ed6,color:#0b3d66
  classDef admin fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#e8590c,color:#7a2e05
  classDef guardian fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
  classDef note fill:#f1f3f5,stroke:#868e96,color:#343a40
